    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIMINAL HELL</strong>. A game that offers many liminal spaces to explore! The INF sends you to the Suite Dreams hotel to complete objectives to further explore other dimensions in the hotel! When completing your main objectives you may unlock a new dimension to further explore and do tasks in! But wait... Something unexpected happened, and now you must escape this Liminal Hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains loud noises, jumpscares, and lots of phobias! This is a phobia game so be aware!</p>",
